config QDX_TC
	tristate "Qualcomm NSS native TC device stage"
	depends on QDX && NET_SCHED && NET_CLS && NET_CLS_ACT && IFB
	help
	  Translate supported native TC objects into an independently accounted
	  NSS device stage. Native queue algorithms, feature permission and IFB
	  continuation remain with their Linux owners. Unsupported policy stays
	  in software unless the user explicitly requires hardware execution.

